hare count has shrunk 4.5% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake."],"people":["With about 8,000 employees, each generates about $384K of revenue, in line with the Industrials median, and productivity has risen 6.2% a year.","That works out to $149K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $2.5M (7x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (3/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $7K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":65,"head":"Watch: LEAN BUY-rated, but only 1% below fair value; it becomes a buy below $176.","pros":["Model rating LEAN BUY (composite 54, gates 15/25)","ROIC 20.7% vs WACC 7.5%","FCF margin 38.8%","Altman Z in the safe zone","Returns 3.3% a year to shareholders"],"cons":["P/E 31.0x vs sector 23.3x","EV/EBITDA 19.8x vs sector 13.3x","12-1 month momentum -22%"],"flags":[],"need":["only 1% below fair value"],"buy_below":176.25,"vc":{"base":207.35,"base_src":"dcf","bear":150.94,"bull":292.94,"alt_median":103.23,"n_alt":2,"gap":1.5255,"dispersion":0.6565,"level":"LOW","why":["models disagree (66% dispersion)","DCF is 153% above the other models' median ($103)"]},"med":{"pe":23.2692,"ev_ebitda":13.319,"pfcf":22.2778,"pb":3.0551,"roic":0.1001,"gross_margin":0.2851,"fcf_margin":0.068,"div_yield":0.0147}},"ticker":"VRSK","date":"2026-11-06"}